{
  "id": "garage_doors",
  "label": "Garage door installation",
  "extends": "_shared",
  "_comment": "A single trade, and the only one that opts out of part of the shared deny list. 'garage door' is in that list precisely so no OTHER trade picks these firms up, and Google files most installers as a garage door supplier, a word that everywhere else means a showroom. deny_remove escapes exactly those two terms; supply, supplies, store, shop, showroom, wholesale and retail stay denied, so a counter is still refused. These firms install and repair the same doors, so both categories are core.",
